From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:21:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add age-based sleep score estimation and complete Material 3
 migration

Sleep score:
- Add AgeSleepScoreCalculator, a transparent 0-100 sleep score that follows the sleep duration recommended for the user's age, age-adjusted deep sleep targets, REM share and sleep efficiency.
- Use the estimate in the sleep charts (day and period), the dashboard day summary and the sleep widgets when a device does not report a native score.
- Attribute a night to the day it ends on, so a session from 23:00 to 07:00 counts for the following day instead of the day it started.
- Add a Material 3 bottom sheet with the score breakdown, opened by tapping the age-adjusted score gauge.
- Add a Charts preference to disable the age-based estimate.

Material 3:
- Migrate the remaining MaterialComponents filter chip, dialog, translucent and text input styles to their Material 3 equivalents.
- Add Material 3 bottom sheet styles and component styles for the new score details sheet.
